  moveName: Night Slash
  description: For 2.5s, movement becomes a dash attack. A successful dash grants
    a long-range special basic. Hitting with special basics or the other normal move
    refreshes the chain and allows another dash. You can keep holding a direction
    while using the special basic; the next dash waits for its recovery. Movement
    after a failed follow-up ends the chain. Six successful attacks trigger an invincible
    aerial cross slash with missing-HP damage and healing. Steer slightly with movement
    while airborne, or use the other normal move to reposition in the air. Cooldown
    begins when the chain ends; reduced by 1s at level 11.
